# REST Client - KHONG luu token/cookie that o tep nay.
# Truoc khi chay: vao trang dang nhap, lay cookie PHPSESSID + csrf tu meta cung phien.
# Co the dung curl -b va trinh duyet; phai chuyen gia tri bien thu cong khi chay.
@base = http://localhost:8000
@sid = THAY_COOKIE_CUA_CHINH_BAN
@csrf = THAY_TOKEN_CUNG_PHIEN

### 1. GET dau trang
GET {{base}}/index.php

### 2. POST thieu csrf -> 403
POST {{base}}/dang-nhap.php
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

email=demo%40foods.example&mat_khau=sai

### 3. API thieu token -> 403 JSON
POST {{base}}/api/gio-hang.php
Content-Type: application/json

{"id":1,"sl":1}

### 4. API co token va phien dung -> 200 (khi mon con ton)
POST {{base}}/api/gio-hang.php
Cookie: PHPSESSID={{sid}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

{"id":1,"sl":1}

### 5. GET dang xuat -> 405
GET {{base}}/dang-xuat.php

### 6. GET xoa-san-pham -> 405
GET {{base}}/xoa-san-pham.php?id=1

### 7. Tham so mang -> khong 500
GET {{base}}/chi-tiet.php?id[]=1

### 8. Khach sua trang thai don -> 403 (can dang nhap tai khoan khach)
POST {{base}}/don-hang.php
Cookie: PHPSESSID={{sid}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

csrf={{csrf}}&id=1&trang_thai=hoan_tat

### 9. 13. GET dat hang khong tao don (xac minh DB truoc/sau)
GET {{base}}/dat-hang.php?xac_nhan=1

# Cac ca con lai (session fixation, het han, CSP, APP_DEBUG, htaccess Apache,
# DB user quyen toi thieu, 5 lan dang nhap sai, quyen chu trang, v.v.)
# can thuc hien bang DevTools / phpMyAdmin, ghi ket qua THUC TE vao bao cao.

### 10. POST san-pham, CSRF hop le -> 405 Allow: GET
POST {{base}}/api/san-pham.php
Cookie: PHPSESSID={{sid}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

### 11. POST gio-hang, so luong vuot gioi han 20 -> 422 (mon con ton kho)
POST {{base}}/api/gio-hang.php
Cookie: PHPSESSID={{sid}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

{"id":1,"sl":21}

### 12. GET danh-sach tham so mang -> khong loi 500
GET {{base}}/danh-sach.php?q[]=ao

### 13. GET trang ca nhan tham so mang -> khong loi 500
GET {{base}}/thanhvien/3120224008_hoanggiabao/gioithieu.php?trang[]=1

### 14. Khach xoa loi nhan chu trang Bao -> 403 (sid/csrf phai cua khach, khong phai chu trang)
POST {{base}}/thanhvien/3120224008_hoanggiabao/gioithieu.php
Cookie: PHPSESSID={{sid}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

csrf={{csrf}}&chuc_nang=xoa&id=1

# Ca Apache, cookie HttpOnly/SameSite, session timeout, 5 lan sai/429 va DB 
# phai kiem chung tren trinh duyet + XAMPP/MySQL; KHONG ghi ket qua gia.
